notes.content:
Good day!

Since the release of our game, we have been very closely following your feedback. Thanks to you, we were able to fix old bugs and add new ones... We are very grateful to you, thank you!
Here is a list of all the fixes:
1. The interaction indicator ([E]) no longer disappears;
2. Jumping enemies no longer get stuck when dropped from the field;
3. Removed circular sight limitation;
4. GIF-animations in tutorial became slower;
5. Sword damage is reduced;
6. Disabled automatic activation of the tutorial at the first start;
7. The button for switching the book page has been made more visible;

The rest of the bugs are in the process of being fixed.
Good luck!

Yours faithfully,
Hide Head Team
